module strategy.strategy_model

import std.nat { Nat }

data strategy_model_note: String = "Strategy kernel (operator directive 2026-08-01, docs/strategy/2026-08-01-strategy-kernel-directive.md). Small set of strong typed concepts, never one generic kind-tagged node. Instantiation lives in strategy.gunbc_strategy; witnesses in test.claim.strategy_witness. Supersedes the flat StrategyNode carrier, deleted in the same change."

data strategy_model_controls_note: String = "Controls coverage, slice 1 of the directive's twelve. BY CONSTRUCTION: 2 - AdoptionEvidence has no roadmap arm, a roadmap merge cannot inhabit adoption evidence; 3 - forecast/observation distinctness is grounded on the public gunbc.econ.acquisition AcquisitionCostForecast carrier (structurally distinct from every observation carrier, per its distinctness note; the private duplicate types were dissolved into that authority 2026-08-01); 5 - journey stage is derived by folding receipts, no stored stage field exists anywhere; market segment vs visibility audience are distinct types. BY DERIVATION WITH WITNESSES: 1 - claim and target status derive from evidence, never stored; 9 - work authorization against a non-Selected decision refuses typed; 12 - experiment continuation against a fired stop receipt refuses. DEFERRED WITH TRIGGERS: 4 needs the claim-evidence kinds to distinguish demo from control receipts, lands with the disclosure carrier; 6 needs cohort and window carriers, lands with first real measurements; 7 and 8 are coverage queries landing when roadmap bindings exceed one row; 10 lands with the publication-grant wall; 11 lands with the first referral observation shape."

